# ClearOmission finding route
:expect-pins 2

# The exact ClearOmission finding route reaches its typed reader duty.
? obliged(Appeals, ReadClearOmissionFindingDuty, ReadClearOmissionFindingStandard).
# => TRUE

# The wrong recipient gains no ClearOmission reader duty.
? obliged(WrongClearOmissionReader, ReadClearOmissionFindingDuty, ReadClearOmissionFindingStandard).
# => FALSE
